rse","number":8,"content":["La salvación pertenece al SEÑOR: sobre tu pueblo es tu bendi­ción. Selah."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}